From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Bogdanov <d.bogdanov@yadro.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:01:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] scsi: Revert "scsi: target: iscsi: Fix hang for aborted
 WRITE_PENDING commands"

This reverts commit d5869dae5080e976d4b03cc33eb7ceb527f242bf as it
introduces double completion of the command and other issues.

Signed-off-by: Dmitry Bogdanov <d.bogdanov@yadro.com>
Reviewed-by: Laurence Oberman <loberman@redhat.com>
Tested-by: Laurence Oberman <loberman@redhat.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261027180123.13163-2-d.bogdanov@yadro.com
Signed-off-by: Martin K. Petersen (Oracle) <mkp@kernel.org>
(cherry picked from commit 94196cd3413fba6cf6d1f71d6de401e56caaf29b)
Signed-off-by: Thomas Lamprecht <t.lamprecht@proxmox.com>
---
 drivers/target/iscsi/iscsi_target.c | 4 +---
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/target/iscsi/iscsi_target.c b/drivers/target/iscsi/iscsi_target.c
index 01be0551193b9d2d3496462ad9d475b94671b385..f3b7569f49dac2d72352f034ffff0605cf894f8e 100644
--- a/drivers/target/iscsi/iscsi_target.c
+++ b/drivers/target/iscsi/iscsi_target.c
@@ -1519,10 +1519,8 @@ __iscsit_check_dataout_hdr(struct iscsit_conn *conn, void *buf,
 		 */
 		if (se_cmd->transport_state & CMD_T_ABORTED) {
 			if (hdr->flags & ISCSI_FLAG_CMD_FINAL &&
-			    --cmd->outstanding_r2ts < 1) {
+			    --cmd->outstanding_r2ts < 1)
 				iscsit_stop_dataout_timer(cmd);
-				target_complete_cmd(se_cmd, SAM_STAT_TASK_ABORTED);
-			}
 
 			return iscsit_dump_data_payload(conn, payload_length, 1);
 		}
